<speak>That's what I'm aiming for. I used to check everything whenever I had a spare minute, and somehow I felt busy without feeling on top of anything. Now I'm trying to have a proper place and time for these tasks. Then when I'm with the family, I'm not halfway through reading a message. It won't change overnight, especially with the business, but I'm noticing the difference already. My daughter said I looked less distracted at dinner, which was nice to hear and also a little embarrassing.</speak>